  id: 78
  missionName: THE IRON GUARD
  missionType: BOSS
  briefing: The iron hall. Kagehira's Iron Guard hold it as one body, and their captain
    calls every change. Toku came up the mountain for this. It is his steel they
    are wearing.
  debrief: The guard is broken. The inner gate is ahead, and the last commander.
